{"title": "Befuddled (Confusion Ray) (Condition)", "pageid": 57494, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Befuddled_(Confusion_Ray)_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status groups", "Has tick type", "Has status properties", "Bugs", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/34/Pacified_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Pacified_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/34/Pacified_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Pacified_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/34/Pacified_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Pacified_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pacified Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/34/Pacified_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Pacified_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/34/Pacified_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Befuddled</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity can't control its actions and wanders around without direction. </li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/38px-Plus_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Status groups\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\">Status groups</a>: <a href=\"/wiki/SG_Stunned\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"SG Stunned\">SG_Stunned</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/SG_Condition\" title=\"SG Condition\">SG_Condition</a>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Duration\" title=\"Conditions\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Loses duration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Duration\" title=\"Conditions\">Loses duration</a>: end of turn\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/InitiateCombat\" title=\"Status properties/InitiateCombat\">InitiateCombat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/OverheadOnTurn\" title=\"Status properties/OverheadOnTurn\">OverheadOnTurn</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\">Bugs</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This condition uses <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pacified_(Condition)\" title=\"Pacified (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/34/Pacified_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Pacified_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/34/Pacified_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Pacified_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/34/Pacified_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Pacified_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pacified\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/34/Pacified_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Pacified_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/34/Pacified_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Pacified_(Condition)\" title=\"Pacified (Condition)\">Pacified</a> (<code>PACIFYING_SPORES</code>) instead of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Befuddled_(Condition)\" title=\"Befuddled (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ab/Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Befuddled\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ab/Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ab/Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Befuddled_(Condition)\" title=\"Befuddled (Condition)\">Befuddled</a> (<code>TIMMASK_SPORES</code>) as a parent. As a result, affected characters are stunned rather than behaving as if they were confused.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Befuddled\">Sources of Befuddled</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Confusion_Ray\" title=\"Confusion Ray\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Confusion Ray\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Confusion_Ray\" title=\"Confusion Ray\">Confusion Ray</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714232928\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.055 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.060 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2061/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 22402/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6246/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.028/7.000 s